    "detailed_description": "Dash Shooters is a multiplayer, fast paced racing game, where the main movement mechanic is dashing! Race your friends to the finish line through a randomly generated map, dodging obstacles, gathering powerups, shooting crystals/other players, and dashing through objectives along the way! There are also in game settings to change the style of play, so there can be countless hours of fun! :)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n-Fast paced movement<br />\r\n-Multiplayer for up to 6 players<br />\r\n-Four unique powerups<br />\r\n-Combat (can be turned on and off)<br />\r\n-Randomly generated maps, with different difficulties<br />\r\n-Objectives to dash through<br />\r\n-Crystals to shoot (great for practicing aim)<br />\r\n-High skill ceiling<br />\r\n-In game settings to change the style of play<br />\r\n-And much more :)",
